@startuml
title Discovery：数据发现与查询模块（skeleton）
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "api" {
  interface DiscoveryQueryService {
    +listPreviewFrames(query)
    +listForecastCycles(query)
    +searchScientificAssets(query)
    +findDownloadCandidatesForPreview(query)
    +getProductAvailability(query)
  }
  class PreviewQuery <<record>>
  class PreviewFrame <<record>>
  class ScientificAssetQuery <<record>>
  class ScientificAssetSummary <<record>>
}
package "application" {
  class MockDiscovery <<skeleton mock>>
}
interface "CatalogQueryService\n(Catalog API)" as CatalogQuery
interface "AssetQueryService\n(AssetIndex API)" as AssetQuery

MockDiscovery ..|> DiscoveryQueryService
MockDiscovery --> CatalogQuery : 确认产品已发布
MockDiscovery --> AssetQuery : 查询文件索引
MockDiscovery ..> PreviewFrame : 预览结果
MockDiscovery ..> ScientificAssetSummary : NC 查询结果

note bottom
Discovery 只查询索引，不扫描硬盘、不执行下载。
end note
@enduml
